## 11. FLOW DIAGRAM

### 11.1 Process Flow (Text Description)

```
START
  ↓
Receive Input Parameters (Customer, Order Value, Sales Org)
  ↓
Validate Input → If Invalid → Raise Exception → END
  ↓
Read Customer Master (KNA1, KNKK, KNVV)
  ↓
Check Credit Hold (KNKK-CTLPC) → If Active → Return REJECTED → END
  ↓
Calculate Current Exposure:
  - Query Open Orders (VBAK/VBUK)
  - Query Open Deliveries (LIKP/LIPS)
  - Query Open Invoices (VBRK/BSID)
  - Sum All Open Documents
  ↓
Read Credit Rules (ZSD_CREDIT_RULES)
  ↓
Apply Tolerance Percentage
  ↓
Check Parent-Child Relationship → If Parent Exists → Consolidate Exposure
  ↓
External Credit Check? → If Yes → Call External API
  ↓
Calculate Available Credit = Credit Limit - Current Exposure
  ↓
Make Credit Decision:
  - If (Order Value + Exposure) ≤ Limit → APPROVED
  - If (Order Value + Exposure) > Limit → REJECTED or MANUAL_REVIEW
  ↓
Log Credit Decision (ZSD_CREDIT_LOG)
  ↓
Return Results to Caller
  ↓
END
```

### 11.2 System Interaction Diagram (Text Description)

```
Sales Order Entry (VA01/Fiori)
  ↓ Calls
Z_SD_VALIDATE_O2C_CREDIT_EXT
  ↓ Reads
Customer Master Tables (KNA1, KNKK, KNVV)
  ↓ Reads
Open Documents (VBAK, VBUK, LIKP, VBRK, BSID)
  ↓ Reads
Configuration (ZSD_CREDIT_RULES)
  ↓ Optional Call
External Credit Bureau API (HTTP)
  ↓ Writes
Audit Log (ZSD_CREDIT_LOG)
  ↓ Returns
Credit Decision to Calling Program
```

